  "id": "monoamine-hypothesis",
  "term": "monoamine hypothesis",
  "definition": "The monoamine hypothesis is the idea that problems in the brain’s monoamine neurotransmitter systems are a major factor in the development of some mental disorders. In this source, it is presented as a long-standing explanation, while noting that treatments based on it have had limited success.",
